  "text": "Bunny video API endpoints now live at https://cdn.divine.video/bunny/*\n\nAvailable endpoints:\n- /bunny/video/:sha256 - Query by hash\n- /bunny/video/guid/:guid - Query by GUID  \n- /bunny/video/uploader/:pubkey - Videos by Nostr pubkey\n- /bunny/events - Webhook events with filters\n- /bunny/events/:guid - Events for specific video\n- /bunny/recent - Recent uploads\n- /bunny/failed - Failed encodings\n- /bunny/processing - Currently processing\n\nAll tested and working in production. No authentication required for reads.\n\nD1 database has two main tables:\n- bunny_webhook_events - All webhook events from Bunny\n- video_metadata - Current state for each video by SHA-256\n\nDocumentation in BUNNY_API.md covers all endpoints with examples.",
